The `POST async/bulk/V1/configurable-products/bySku/options` call assigns the specified `attribute_id` to be the configurable attribute.

 The `attribute_id` and its value may be different on your installation. Check the values carefully before using them in your calls. To get the correct `attribute_id`, see [Get the list of attributes defined in an attribute searchCriteria](https://developer.adobe.com/commerce/webapi/rest/tutorials/configurable-product/plan-product/#get-the-list-of-attributes-defined-in-an-attribute-searchcriteria) for more information.

 The value assigned to the `value_index` must be unique within the system.

 **Endpoint:**

