{
  "items": [
    {
      "order_item_id": 3,
      "qty": 1
    },
    {
      "order_item_id": 5,
      "qty": 1
    },
    {
      "order_item_id": 11,
      "qty": 1
    }
  ],
  "notify": true,
  "tracks": [
    {
      "track_number": "1Y-9876543210",
      "title": "United Parcel Service",
      "carrier_code": "ups"
    }
  ]
}
```

**Response:**

A shipment ID, such as `3`.

